# Keeps the build context small for apps/*/Dockerfile builds (context is the
# repo root, since these are pnpm-workspace monorepo builds). Each Dockerfile
# COPYs in only the paths it actually needs.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/target
**/.venv
**/.pnpm-store
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
.github
infrastructure
contracts
workers
docs
*.md
